r</li></ul><p class="mt-auto pt-10 text-plum/80">Prefer email? Write to<!-- --> <a href="mailto:hello@modulify.ai" class="font-semibold text-plum underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-coral">hello@modulify.ai</a></p></div><div class="reveal-right rounded-[2.5rem] border-2 border-plum bg-card p-7 shadow-[0_6px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] [--reveal-delay:150ms] sm:p-10"><form noValidate="" class="relative" aria-describedby="contact-form-note"><h3 class="font-heading text-3xl text-plum">Tell us about it</h3><p id="contact-form-note" class="mt-1 text-sm text-plum/70">Fields marked with * are required.</p><div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><label for="contact-name" class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 font-heading text-lg tracking-wide text-plum">Your name *</label><div class="relative mt-2"><input id="contact-name" type="text" autoComplete="name" required="" maxLength="120" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="Jamie Rivera" class="w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-plum/25 bg-white/70 px-4 py-3 text-base text-plum transition-all duration-200 placeholder:text-plum/40 hover:border-plum/50 focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:border-plum focus:bg-white focus:shadow-[0_4px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-butter/70 aria-[invalid=true]:border-red-600 aria-[invalid=true]:animate-jelly" name="name" value=""/></div></div><div><label for="contact-email" class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 font-heading text-lg tracking-wide text-plum">Email *</label><div class="relative mt-2"><input id="contact-email" type="email" inputMode="email" autoComplete="email" required="" maxLength="200" aria-invalid="false" placeholder="jamie@yourbrand.com" class="w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-plum/25 bg-white/70 px-4 py-3 text-base text-plum transition-all duration-200 placeholder:text-plum/40 hover:border-plum/50 focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:border-plum focus:bg-white focus:shadow-[0_4px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-butter/70 aria-[invalid=true]:border-red-600 aria-[invalid=true]:animate-jelly" name="email" value=""/></div></div><div><label for="contact-phone" class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 font-heading text-lg tracking-wide text-plum">Phone</label><div class="relative mt-2"><input id="contact-phone" type="tel" inputMode="tel" autoComplete="tel" maxLength="40" placeholder="(503) 555-0142" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-plum/25 bg-white/70 px-4 py-3 text-base text-plum transition-all duration-200 placeholder:text-plum/40 hover:border-plum/50 focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:border-plum focus:bg-white focus:shadow-[0_4px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-butter/70 aria-[invalid=true]:border-red-600 aria-[invalid=true]:animate-jelly" name="phone" value=""/></div></div><div><label for="contact-topic" class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 font-heading text-lg tracking-wide text-plum">What can we help with?</label><div class="relative mt-2"><select id="contact-topic" name="topic" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-plum/25 bg-white/70 px-4 py-3 text-base transition-all duration-200 placeholder:text-plum/40 hover:border-plum/50 focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:border-plum focus:bg-white focus:shadow-[0_4px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-butter/70 aria-[invalid=true]:border-red-600 aria-[invalid=true]:animate-jelly appearance-none pr-11 text-plum/50"><option value="" selected="">Pick a topic</option><option value="Branding &amp; identity" class="text-plum">Branding &amp; identity</option><option value="Website" class="text-plum">Website</option><option value="Content &amp; social" class="text-plum">Content &amp; social</option><option value="Growth marketing" class="text-plum">Growth marketing</option><option value